<?php $pageTitle='Privacy Policy — LocalConnect';require __DIR__.'/includes/header.php';?><main class="container py-5"><article class="legal-card"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-muted">Development MVP policy template — update with legal counsel before production launch.</p><h2>Information we store</h2><p>LocalConnect stores account information, selected service-area/location fields, profile information, service requests, reviews, favorites, notifications and moderation records needed to operate the platform.</p><h2>Location</h2><p>Precise latitude and longitude are optional. The MVP primarily uses manually entered city, state, area and pincode information and does not calculate fake distances.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>Passwords are stored as password hashes. Application forms use validation, output escaping, prepared database statements and CSRF protection where applicable.</p><h2>Before production</h2><p>Configure a production privacy policy, retention schedule, cookie disclosures, support contact and applicable Indian data-protection compliance before accepting real users.</p></article></main><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
